# Release identity baked into an image at build time (READY-001 / Task A5,
# `scripts/build_release_manifest.py --emit-identity`). Generated per build
# and read back at runtime by `app_shared.release`; committing it would let a
# stale bake ship silently in a later image.
/release_identity.json

